WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.459
O.K., you need to see this really quick.

00:00:01.459 --> 00:00:02.877
During the recent cease fire

00:00:02.877 --> 00:00:05.296
between Israel and Hamas, Israel released

00:00:05.296 --> 00:00:07.966
240 Palestinians from prison.

00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:10.010
But this is what's crazy, that same week.

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:14.014
they also arrested 133 Palestinians.

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:14.889
This is what a lot of people

00:00:14.889 --> 00:00:15.682
don't really understand

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:16.850
about the Israeli occupation.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:17.684
Is that one of the most

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:19.519
egregious things that Israel does

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:21.688
is that they just arrest Palestinians

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:23.148
without charging them with a crime.

00:00:23.148 --> 00:00:23.523
A lot of these

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:26.234
Palestinians are like teenage boys

00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:26.985
who are arrested

00:00:26.985 --> 00:00:29.738
for like effectively throwing stones,

00:00:29.738 --> 00:00:30.905
Since the terrorist attack of October

00:00:30.905 --> 00:00:32.782
7th, Israel has been going nuts

00:00:32.782 --> 00:00:34.701
on arresting people in the West Bank,

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:36.286
which is different than Gaza,

00:00:36.286 --> 00:00:37.203
where Hamas is.

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:37.746
They've detained over

00:00:37.746 --> 00:00:39.873
3000 Palestinians in the West Bank,

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:40.957
which is ten times

00:00:40.957 --> 00:00:41.750
the number of people

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:42.667
that they've released.

00:00:42.667 --> 00:00:43.084
These people

00:00:43.084 --> 00:00:44.544
don't know why they're arrested.

00:00:44.544 --> 00:00:46.212
They will never have a trial, like,

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:47.505
this is not due process.

00:00:47.505 --> 00:00:48.673
This is not the rule of law.

00:00:48.673 --> 00:00:50.842
This is occupation. It's wrong.

00:00:50.842 --> 00:00:52.260
Many of these kids

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:53.178
are going to be in prison

00:00:53.178 --> 00:00:54.804
for months or years.

00:00:54.804 --> 00:00:55.805
If you want to better understand

00:00:55.805 --> 00:00:57.724
global politics, follow along for more.

